/**
 * The plugin-built header: what the diagram builder (src/diagrams/header.ts, assembleDiagram) prepends to a model's
 * diagram body, and what validateMermaidSource accepts with allowPluginHeader. The builder writes its configuration as
 * the single-line JSON that JSON.stringify produces (valid YAML flow style), so the guard reads that form as well as
 * indented lines, and checks both against one closed schema.
 *
 * ASSEMBLED holds literal output of assembleDiagram for every style recipe and every diagram kind, one for each
 * distinct header shape (colours differ with the hue, and are not part of the shape). They are copied, not
 * regenerated, so a change to the builder that leaves the grammar breaks the builder's own test, and a change to the
 * grammar that rejects what the builder writes breaks this one.
 */
